{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Unique Combat-Platforming Challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The map is a playground and the enemies are just another toy in it. Gain height and speed by using the enemies to the fullest as platforms and grappling points. Symbiote has a heavy emphasis on momentum. Sliding down slopes will speed you up and jumping off ramps will send you flying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058000/extras/65c597bf94552aec3e73974c85ffbf75.poster.avif?t=1760063499\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058000/extras/65c597bf94552aec3e73974c85ffbf75.webm?t=1760063499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058000/extras/65c597bf94552aec3e73974c85ffbf75.mp4?t=1760063499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Wide Variety of Missions To Complete</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every collectable is tied to a challenge that will test your abilities in combat and platforming and your ability to weave the two together.\u00a0 The clock is running so plan out a route and try and see if you can set a record time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058000/extras/aada6f0fd4e5e3eafab2056a98ac8d34.poster.avif?t=1760063499\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058000/extras/aada6f0fd4e5e3eafab2056a98ac8d34.webm?t=1760063499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058000/extras/aada6f0fd4e5e3eafab2056a98ac8d34.mp4?t=1760063499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Serious Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Symbiote breaks the mold of the playful platformer and delivers a story with stakes. It explores themes of childhood trauma, psychosis, public land ownership, and the struggles of connecting with others as a lifelong outcast.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Solo Dev Passion Project</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Symbiote is a game developed off of the questions: &quot;What if combat in 3D platformers engaged with the platforming mechanics?&quot; and &quot;What if platforming in action games wasn't just a tacked-on feature?&quot; There's so much potential in combining the strengths of both genres into a greater whole. I developed Symbiote to finally achieve that.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4058000?t=1760063499","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4058000?t=1760063499","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058000/e69bb91bd8709437cfd3a324e156d4ffd5364892/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760063499","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058000/e69bb91bd8709437cfd3a324e156d4ffd5364892/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760063499","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Symbiote has a serious story which features violence on a level that should be suitable for teenagers and older."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4060380,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Unique Combat-Platforming Challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The map is a playground and the enemies are just another toy in it. Gain height and speed by using the enemies to the fullest as platforms and grappling points. Symbiote has a heavy emphasis on momentum. Sliding down slopes will speed you up and jumping off ramps will send you flying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058000/extras/65c597bf94552aec3e73974c85ffbf75.poster.avif?t=1760063499\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058000/extras/65c597bf94552aec3e73974c85ffbf75.webm?t=1760063499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058000/extras/65c597bf94552aec3e73974c85ffbf75.mp4?t=1760063499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Wide Variety of Missions To Complete</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every collectable is tied to a challenge that will test your abilities in combat and platforming and your ability to weave the two together.\u00a0 The clock is running so plan out a route and try and see if you can set a record time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058000/extras/aada6f0fd4e5e3eafab2056a98ac8d34.poster.avif?t=1760063499\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058000/extras/aada6f0fd4e5e3eafab2056a98ac8d34.webm?t=1760063499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058000/extras/aada6f0fd4e5e3eafab2056a98ac8d34.mp4?t=1760063499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Serious Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Symbiote breaks the mold of the playful platformer and delivers a story with stakes. It explores themes of childhood trauma, psychosis, public land ownership, and the struggles of connecting with others as a lifelong outcast.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Solo Dev Passion Project</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Symbiote is a game developed off of the questions: &quot;What if combat in 3D platformers engaged with the platforming mechanics?&quot; and &quot;What if platforming in action games wasn't just a tacked-on feature?&quot; There's so much potential in combining the strengths of both genres into a greater whole. I developed Symbiote to finally achieve that.</p>","developers":["Trickster"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058000/25aa1b90e1a09be647fbd15642c3044aef08e8f1/header.jpg?t=1760063499","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Symbiote","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.0 GHz processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1660 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Trickster"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Linguagem impr\u00f3pria\nViol\u00eancia\nAtos criminosos","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt\nDerbe Sprache","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058000/ccc20fd40867eddf86e8ce568eda4bf4b32cd2c7/ss_ccc20fd40867eddf86e8ce568eda4bf4b32cd2c7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760063499","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.aka